<title>USA: Aldine ISD, Texas won by A.G. Edwards.</title>
<headline>Aldine ISD, Texas won by A.G. Edwards.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>A.G. Edwards &amp; Sons, Inc. said it won $7.550 million of Aldine ISD, Texas, public property finance limited tax contractual obligations, Series 1996 S, with a true interest cost of 4.8344 percent.</p>
</text>
